{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-393","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-1015","text":"The [&] Umbrella — one stack: declare → … → observe"}]},{"id":"blk-394","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-1016","marks":["bold"],"text":"Status:"},{"id":"spn-1017","text":" living map · "},{"id":"spn-1018","marks":["bold"],"text":"Audience:"},{"id":"spn-1019","text":" anyone trying to see how "},{"id":"spn-1020","marks":["code"],"text":"[&]"},{"id":"spn-1021","text":", "},{"id":"spn-1022","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box"},{"id":"spn-1023","text":", CC1, and CC2 fit into a single system rather than separate folders."}]},{"id":"blk-395","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-1024","marks":["code"],"text":"[&]"},{"id":"spn-1025","text":" (AmpersandBoxDesign) is the umbrella. "},{"id":"spn-1026","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box"},{"id":"spn-1027","text":" is the governance "},{"id":"spn-1028","marks":["bold"],"text":"engine"},{"id":"spn-1029","text":" that lives inside it ("},{"id":"spn-1030","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box/"},{"id":"spn-1031","text":"). They are not competing protocols and they are not redundant — they are different layers of one pipeline. This document is the single place that draws that pipeline and marks what exists vs. what is still spec-only."}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-397","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-1032","text":"One-line mental model: "},{"id":"spn-1033","marks":["bold"],"text":"`[&]` declares and composes capabilities; `box-and-box` decides whether a composed action is `feasible ▸ permitted ▸ best`; MCP/A2A wire the result to the world."}]}],"id":"blk-396","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-398","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-1034","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-399","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-1035","text":"1. The pipeline"}]},{"id":"blk-400","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-1036","text":"A capability set flows through seven stages:"}]},{"id":"blk-401","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"declare → validate → compose → govern → wire → run → observe"},{"head":[{"id":"blk-403","spans":[{"id":"spn-1037","text":"Stage"}]},{"id":"blk-404","spans":[{"id":"spn-1038","text":"Question it answers"}]},{"id":"blk-405","spans":[{"id":"spn-1039","text":"Owned by"}]},{"id":"blk-406","spans":[{"id":"spn-1040","text":"Status"}]}],"id":"blk-402","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-407","spans":[{"id":"spn-1041","marks":["bold"],"text":"declare"}]},{"id":"blk-408","spans":[{"id":"spn-1042","text":"what capabilities, held by whom, piped how?"}]},{"id":"blk-409","spans":[{"id":"spn-1043","marks":["code"],"text":"[&]"},{"id":"spn-1044","text":" schema ("},{"id":"spn-1045","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-1046","text":"); CC2 coalition object"}]},{"id":"blk-410","spans":[{"id":"spn-1047","text":"CC1 ✅ shipped · CC2 "},{"id":"spn-1048","marks":["code"],"text":"coalition.schema.json"},{"id":"spn-1049","text":" ✅ shipped (no runtime yet)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-411","spans":[{"id":"spn-1050","marks":["bold"],"text":"validate"}]},{"id":"blk-412","spans":[{"id":"spn-1051","text":"does the declaration conform?"}]},{"id":"blk-413","spans":[{"id":"spn-1052","marks":["code"],"text":"@ampersand-protocol/validate"},{"id":"spn-1053","text":" (npm), Python SDK, Elixir "},{"id":"spn-1054","marks":["code"],"text":"schema.ex"}]},{"id":"blk-414","spans":[{"id":"spn-1055","text":"✅ — "},{"id":"spn-1056","marks":["bold"],"text":"CC1 only"},{"id":"spn-1057","text":" (CC2 validates via the schema directly, ajv)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-415","spans":[{"id":"spn-1058","marks":["bold"],"text":"compose"}]},{"id":"blk-416","spans":[{"id":"spn-1059","text":"do the "},{"id":"spn-1060","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-1061","text":" / `\\"}]},{"id":"blk-417","spans":[{"id":"spn-1062","text":">` combinations hold?"}]},{"id":"blk-418","spans":[{"id":"spn-1063","text":"Elixir "},{"id":"spn-1064","marks":["code"],"text":"compose.ex"},{"id":"spn-1065","text":"; CC2 lifts `\\"}]},{"id":"blk-419","spans":[{"id":"spn-1066","text":">` to a governed pipeline"}]},{"id":"blk-420","spans":[{"id":"spn-1067","text":"CC1 "},{"id":"spn-1068","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-1069","text":" ✅ · `\\"}]},{"id":"blk-421","spans":[{"id":"spn-1070","text":">"},{"id":"spn-1071","marks":["code"],"text":" still lawless · CC1→singleton-coalition lift ✅ ("},{"id":"spn-1072","text":"box-and-box lift`) · cross-agent coalition compose ❌"}]}],[{"id":"blk-422","spans":[{"id":"spn-1073","marks":["bold"],"text":"govern"}]},{"id":"blk-423","spans":[{"id":"spn-1074","text":"is this action "},{"id":"spn-1075","marks":["code"],"text":"feasible ▸ permitted ▸ best"},{"id":"spn-1076","text":"?"}]},{"id":"blk-424","spans":[{"id":"spn-1077","marks":["bold"],"text":"box-and-box"},{"id":"spn-1078","text":" (8 rungs, 103 laws)"}]},{"id":"blk-425","spans":[{"id":"spn-1079","text":"engine ✅ · CC1 governance bridge ✅ ("},{"id":"spn-1080","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box compile"},{"id":"spn-1081","text":") · coalition wiring ❌"}]}],[{"id":"blk-426","spans":[{"id":"spn-1082","marks":["bold"],"text":"wire"}]},{"id":"blk-427","spans":[{"id":"spn-1083","text":"emit MCP + A2A configs"}]},{"id":"blk-428","spans":[{"id":"spn-1084","text":"Elixir "},{"id":"spn-1085","marks":["code"],"text":"mcp.ex"},{"id":"spn-1086","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-1087","marks":["code"],"text":"a2a.ex"}]},{"id":"blk-429","spans":[{"id":"spn-1088","text":"✅ — CC1 only"}]}],[{"id":"blk-430","spans":[{"id":"spn-1089","marks":["bold"],"text":"run"}]},{"id":"blk-431","spans":[{"id":"spn-1090","text":"gate every effect *before* it fires (interpositional host)"}]},{"id":"blk-432","spans":[{"id":"spn-1091","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box/aios/"},{"id":"spn-1092","text":" reference host"}]},{"id":"blk-433","spans":[{"id":"spn-1093","text":"illustrative only ❌ no real runtime"}]}],[{"id":"blk-434","spans":[{"id":"spn-1094","marks":["bold"],"text":"observe"}]},{"id":"blk-435","spans":[{"id":"spn-1095","text":"emit an auditable decision certificate + evolve the policy on a provenance chain"}]},{"id":"blk-436","spans":[{"id":"spn-1096","text":"box-and-box certs + "},{"id":"spn-1097","marks":["code"],"text":"evolution.mjs"},{"id":"spn-1098","text":" hash-chain + PULSE cross-loop bus"}]},{"id":"blk-437","spans":[{"id":"spn-1099","text":"certs ✅ · provenance chain + measured/priced/certified "},{"id":"spn-1100","marks":["code"],"text":"evolve()"},{"id":"spn-1101","text":" ✅ (EV1–EV6) · CloudEvents emission (CC2 §7) ❌"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-438","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-1102","text":"Two supporting artifacts sit alongside: the "},{"id":"spn-1103","marks":["bold"],"text":"registry"},{"id":"spn-1104","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-1105","marks":["code"],"text":"protocol/registry/v0.1.0/"},{"id":"spn-1106","text":", ✅) and the "},{"id":"spn-1107","marks":["bold"],"text":"conformance suite"},{"id":"spn-1108","text":" (103 laws — ✅ in JS, no second-host cross-language harness yet ❌)."}]},{"id":"blk-439","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-1109","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-440","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-1110","text":"2. The govern stage is split in two (the keystone gap)"}]},{"id":"blk-441","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-1111","text":"Today there are "},{"id":"spn-1112","marks":["bold"],"text":"two governance implementations that do not talk to each other"},{"id":"spn-1113","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-442","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-1114","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-1115","marks":["code"],"text":"reference/elixir/ampersand_core/governance.ex"},{"id":"spn-1116","text":" — the CC1 governance block evaluator. Parses flat compact conditions ("},{"id":"spn-1117","marks":["code"],"text":"confidence_below:0.75"},{"id":"spn-1118","text":", "},{"id":"spn-1119","marks":["code"],"text":"cost_exceeds_usd:1000"},{"id":"spn-1120","text":") into "},{"id":"spn-1121","marks":["code"],"text":"pass"},{"id":"spn-1122","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-1123","marks":["code"],"text":"escalate"},{"id":"spn-1124","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-1125","marks":["code"],"text":"block"},{"id":"spn-1126","text":". Ad-hoc, no algebra. This is the \"flat governance block\" CC2 §0 explicitly sets out to replace. 2. "},{"id":"spn-1127","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box/"},{"id":"spn-1128","text":" — the real 8-rung modal arithmetic with 103 property-tested laws. Takes its "},{"id":"spn-1129","marks":["bold"],"text":"own"},{"id":"spn-1130","text":" decision-spec JSON ("},{"id":"spn-1131","marks":["code"],"text":"{req, norms, options}"},{"id":"spn-1132","text":"), not an "},{"id":"spn-1133","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-1134","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-443","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-1135","text":"Nothing bridges them. Until a composed "},{"id":"spn-1136","marks":["code"],"text":"[&]"},{"id":"spn-1137","text":" capability set's "},{"id":"spn-1138","marks":["code"],"text":"governance"},{"id":"spn-1139","text":" block is evaluated *through* the box-and-box rungs, the umbrella is two products in one repo. "},{"id":"spn-1140","marks":["bold"],"text":"Closing this is the single highest-leverage step"},{"id":"spn-1141","text":"; everything else (CC2 schema, coalition compose, interpositional host) builds on it."}]},{"id":"blk-444","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-1142","text":"The bridge is a deterministic translation (no LLM, no network) from the CC1 governance block to a box-and-box policy:"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-446","spans":[{"id":"spn-1143","marks":["code"],"text":"[&]"},{"id":"spn-1144","text":" governance (CC1)"}]},{"id":"blk-447","spans":[{"id":"spn-1145","text":"box-and-box"}]},{"id":"blk-448","spans":[{"id":"spn-1146","text":"Rung"}]}],"id":"blk-445","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-449","spans":[{"id":"spn-1147","marks":["code"],"text":"escalate_when.confidence_below: θ"}]},{"id":"blk-450","spans":[{"id":"spn-1148","marks":["code"],"text":"req.beta_min = θ"},{"id":"spn-1149","text":" (feasibility floor)"}]},{"id":"blk-451","spans":[{"id":"spn-1150","text":"alethic"}]}],[{"id":"blk-452","spans":[{"id":"spn-1151","marks":["code"],"text":"escalate_when.cost_exceeds_usd: C"}]},{"id":"blk-453","spans":[{"id":"spn-1152","marks":["code"],"text":"OBLIGATORY"},{"id":"spn-1153","text":" norm w/ CTD "},{"id":"spn-1154","marks":["code"],"text":"escalate-to-human"},{"id":"spn-1155","text":", condition "},{"id":"spn-1156","marks":["code"],"text":"cost > C"}]},{"id":"blk-454","spans":[{"id":"spn-1157","text":"deontic"}]}],[{"id":"blk-455","spans":[{"id":"spn-1158","marks":["code"],"text":"escalate_when.hard_boundary_approached: true"}]},{"id":"blk-456","spans":[{"id":"spn-1159","marks":["code"],"text":"OBLIGATORY"},{"id":"spn-1160","text":" escalate when truthy"}]},{"id":"blk-457","spans":[{"id":"spn-1161","text":"deontic"}]}],[{"id":"blk-458","spans":[{"id":"spn-1162","marks":["code"],"text":"hard: [machine-checkable cond]"}]},{"id":"blk-459","spans":[{"id":"spn-1163","marks":["code"],"text":"FORBIDDEN"},{"id":"spn-1164","text":" norm on the floor (→ "},{"id":"spn-1165","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-1166","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-460","spans":[{"id":"spn-1167","text":"deontic + alethic"}]}],[{"id":"blk-461","spans":[{"id":"spn-1168","marks":["code"],"text":"hard"},{"id":"spn-1169","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-1170","marks":["code"],"text":"soft"},{"id":"spn-1171","text":" natural-language strings"}]},{"id":"blk-462","spans":[{"id":"spn-1172","marks":["bold"],"text":"carried as `requiresJudgment`, not auto-evaluated"}]},{"id":"blk-463","spans":[{"id":"spn-1173","text":"—"}]}],[{"id":"blk-464","spans":[{"id":"spn-1174","marks":["code"],"text":"soft: [...]"},{"id":"spn-1175","text":" preferences"}]},{"id":"blk-465","spans":[{"id":"spn-1176","text":"score gradient (needs option utilities)"}]},{"id":"blk-466","spans":[{"id":"spn-1177","text":"axiological"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-467","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-1178","text":"Natural-language "},{"id":"spn-1179","marks":["code"],"text":"hard"},{"id":"spn-1180","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-1181","marks":["code"],"text":"soft"},{"id":"spn-1182","text":" rules cannot be mechanically evaluated and MUST NOT be silently dropped or fabricated — the bridge surfaces them as items requiring human/LLM judgement."}]},{"id":"blk-468","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-1183","text":"See "},{"id":"spn-1184","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box compile <ampersand.json>"},{"id":"spn-1185","text":" (the implemented bridge) and "},{"id":"spn-1186","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/CC2-capability-composition.md"},{"id":"spn-1187","text":" (the full normative expansion table) for the coalition-level version."}]},{"id":"blk-469","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-1188","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-470","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-1189","text":"3. CC1 vs CC2 vs box-and-box (the three terms people conflate)"}]},{"id":"blk-471","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-473","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-1190","marks":["bold"],"text":"CC1"},{"id":"spn-1191","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-1192","marks":["code"],"text":"[&]"},{"id":"spn-1193","text":" Protocol v1: single-agent capability composition. The shipped "},{"id":"spn-1194","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-1195","text":" schema at "},{"id":"spn-1196","marks":["code"],"text":"protocol.ampersandboxdesign.com/schema/v0.1.0"},{"id":"spn-1197","text":". Live and authoritative."}]}],"id":"blk-472","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-475","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-1198","marks":["bold"],"text":"CC2"},{"id":"spn-1199","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-1200","marks":["code"],"text":"[&]"},{"id":"spn-1201","text":" Protocol v2: lifts composition to a "},{"id":"spn-1202","marks":["bold"],"text":"coalition"},{"id":"spn-1203","text":" (owners, common-knowledge, joint trajectory, ability). Draft RFC in "},{"id":"spn-1204","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/CC2-capability-composition.md"},{"id":"spn-1205","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-1206","marks":["code"],"text":"SPEC.md §10"},{"id":"spn-1207","text":". CC1 is the singleton special case of CC2 ("},{"id":"spn-1208","marks":["code"],"text":"agents:[self]"},{"id":"spn-1209","text":"); runtimes accept CC1 docs unchanged."}]}],"id":"blk-474","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-477","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-1210","marks":["bold"],"text":"box-and-box"},{"id":"spn-1211","text":" — the verdict "},{"id":"spn-1212","marks":["bold"],"text":"engine"},{"id":"spn-1213","text":" both compile down to. NOT a composition protocol and NOT the "},{"id":"spn-1214","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-1215","text":" validator. The 8-rung ladder + 103 laws (incl. the evolution bridge EV1–EV6 — measured/priced/certified policy change on a provenance chain, a join across the reflexive × axiological × resource rungs, not a ninth rung)."}]}],"id":"blk-476","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-478","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-1216","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-479","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-1217","text":"4. What \"done\" looks like"}]},{"id":"blk-480","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-1218","text":"The umbrella is coherent when:"}]},{"id":"blk-481","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-1219","text":"1. an "},{"id":"spn-1220","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-1221","text":" governance block is judged by box-and-box, not "},{"id":"spn-1222","marks":["code"],"text":"governance.ex"},{"id":"spn-1223","text":" (govern bridge — "},{"id":"spn-1224","marks":["bold"],"text":"partially shipped via `box-and-box compile`"},{"id":"spn-1225","text":"); 2. "},{"id":"spn-1226","marks":["code"],"text":"coalition.schema.json"},{"id":"spn-1227","text":" exists and a CC1→singleton-coalition lifter passes the RFC §6 migration ("},{"id":"spn-1228","marks":["bold"],"text":"shipped: schema + `box-and-box lift`; CC1 docs lift to a valid singleton coalition"},{"id":"spn-1229","text":"); 3. "},{"id":"spn-1230","marks":["code"],"text":"\\|>"},{"id":"spn-1231","text":" carries laws, holders, and feasibility annihilation (CC2 compose); 4. a real interpositional host runs "},{"id":"spn-1232","marks":["code"],"text":"govern"},{"id":"spn-1233","text":" before any consequential effect (replacing the illustrative "},{"id":"spn-1234","marks":["code"],"text":"aios/"},{"id":"spn-1235","text":"); 5. certificates are emitted as CloudEvents on the PULSE bus (the local provenance hash-chain in "},{"id":"spn-1236","marks":["code"],"text":"evolution.mjs"},{"id":"spn-1237","text":" is the substrate; CloudEvents transport still open); 6. a second conformant host (Elixir) agrees verdict-for-verdict with the JS engine."}]},{"id":"blk-482","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-1238","text":"Item 2 is shipped at the schema+lifter level (no coalition runtime yet). Item 1 is in progress. Items 3–6 are open. "},{"id":"spn-1239","marks":["bold"],"text":"Beyond the original six:"},{"id":"spn-1240","text":" the evolution surface ("},{"id":"spn-1241","marks":["code"],"text":"evolution.mjs"},{"id":"spn-1242","text":", EV1–EV6) now answers \"may this *policy* change, did it improve, is it worth paying for?\" on a tamper-evident provenance chain — the self-improvement/change-manifest layer that turns the observe stage into a real evolution loop."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieramwns23bkzfrhkvka7dij5lfrwdlhmnoi2h7y7zuoxrkvztvnstrq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}